{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This application features a &quot;MESUGAKI&quot; monitoring your computer's desktop screen! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She will watch over the mouse cursor and move her head in sync with the mouse cursor. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you place her over a window, it will appear as if she's sitting!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Supports multiple displays, including dual displays.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left-click and drag: Move the model</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Right-click: Open the menu</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How to Play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- This is a desktop mascot that runs on your PC desktop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- The model will be displayed and will look at the mouse cursor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- You can move the model by left-clicking and dragging the mouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Supports multiple displays, including dual displays!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Streaming Guidelines</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This application may be used for video streaming and other purposes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When using this application for video streaming and other purposes, please include the application name and Steam store page URL in the description section, if possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The developer assumes no responsibility for any problems that may arise from using this application for video streaming and other purposes.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4087720?t=1768279066","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4087720?t=1768279066","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087720/fd3c06d91b42cde564a3662a51d718b8be12ab4d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768279066","capsule